        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lari White, Chuck Cannon, Vicky McGehee, Danny Gokey\n- Songs: “I Will Not Say Goodbye”\n- TV Shows: American Idol, You Can Be a Star, The Nashville Network\n- Roles: songwriter, recording artist, country music artist, actress, finalist, winner\n\nFacts:\n- Lari Michele White was born on May 13, 1965, and she is an American country music artist and actress.\n- In 1988, Lari White first gained national attention as a winner on “You Can Be a Star,” a talent competition that aired on The Nashville Network.\n- The song “I Will Not Say Goodbye” was written by Lari White, Chuck Cannon, and Vicky McGehee.\n- Danny Gokey, an American Idol season 8 finalist, recorded “I Will Not Say Goodbye.”",
